  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "What's included with every booking?",
      "a": "Everything. Concert-quality speakers, wireless microphones, a large lyrics screen, dynamic LED stage lighting, a professional host/MC, 90,000+ songs, full setup and teardown, and social media content creation at no extra charge."
    },
    {
      "q": "How far in advance should I book?",
      "a": "Summer and holiday weekends fill up fast — sometimes 4–6 weeks out. We recommend booking at least 2–3 weeks in advance."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you travel to Chicago?",
      "a": "Yes! We regularly serve the entire Chicagoland area in addition to Northwest Indiana. Travel fees may apply depending on distance."
    },
    {
      "q": "How long do bookings typically last?",
      "a": "Most private events run 2–4 hours. Bar residencies are typically 3–4 hours. Setup and teardown are not counted against your booked time."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you provide a certificate of insurance?",
      "a": "Yes. If your venue requires a COI, we can provide one. Just let us know the venue's requirements when you book."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can guests request songs in advance?",
      "a": "Absolutely. You and your guests can submit song requests ahead of the event, and we'll make sure they're ready to go."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can you handle large events with 100+ guests?",
      "a": "Yes — we've hosted events with 200+ guests. Our sound system is scaled to fill large spaces."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you need a stage or special power setup?",
      "a": "No stage needed. We work in backyards, living rooms, banquet halls, bars, breweries — anywhere there's enough space. We just need standard electrical outlets."
    }
  ],
